    {
      "text": "His body shines with dense white light. He points, and that light becomes a spear about 1.8 m long and 0.6 m thick. One cast spends sixty percent of the purple crystal essence in his aperture. The spear clears fog on the mound, vaporizes thousands of dogs where it lands, and leaves a crater. Bai Ning Bing judges that a direct hit would break her defensive Gu in under a second.",
